  unitName: Legnaura
  unitId: 20083
  unitNumber: 359
  description: A water dragon that is said to have appeared only to cleanse the sea
    after it had been polluted. The clean water that poured from its body was said
    to have the power to heal all kinds of sicknesses. However, with every appearance
    it made its body grew weak and its life short. The main theory is that this was
    due to the toxins that had built up in its body, though others say it was because
    of its continuous fighting against the source of the sea pollution.
  summonDesc: It's useless to cleanse something<br>without attacking the impurity's
    source.<br>Let end the cause of this evil.
  fusionDesc: Pure hearted Summoner. <br>I will receive this power<br>you've bestowed
    to me.
  evoDesc: This isn't just water.<br>It has the power to <br>cleanse the world.
  element: 2
  rarity: 3
